    pav:createdWith :software ;
    dct:description "Parsed the State/Possession and Military tables from Publication 28 Appendix B. The Geographic Directional table on the same page is excluded deliberately: it defines NE as Northeast, where the State/Possession table defines NE as Nebraska." .

